      "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains a large-scale collection of tables from the financial earnings reports of Fortune 500 companies. It is derived from the ComTQA dataset, which in turn is based on the original FinTabNet dataset released by IBM Research. \nThis version has been modified to make each question specific to a single document. This change transforms the dataset into a benchmark for question answering over a large corpus of different PDFs, designed to evaluate a system's\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://hf-mirror.com/datasets/corvicai/FinTabNet_ComTQA.",
